          "id": "item-93fa4d7a",
          "title": "Mechatronics Engineer",
          "subtitle": "AbCellera Biologics Inc",
          "location": "Vancouver, BC",
          "dates": "May 2020 – Current",
          "note": "",
          "description": "",
          "bullets": [
            "Increased cell transport speed 3x by moving liquid handling from open-loop to calibrated closed-loop control using vision-based measurements, while keeping cell viability high.",
            "Delivered control software for a new single-cell recovery instrument in LabVIEW and Python (robot routines, state machines, operator UI, imaging), three weeks ahead of a key demo.",
            "Built image processing pipelines in Python, C++ and LabVIEW, including meniscus detection in micro-capillaries, multi-exposure HDR and flat-field correction.",
            "Built a tool to review past recoveries and retry failed ones, cutting potential cell loss by up to 50%, with auto-generated PDF reports and machine-learning summaries for troubleshooting.",
            "Built a real-time fleet dashboard (Go, SQLite, JavaScript) for robot metrics, environmental data and experiment progress on a shared data schema, including maps of recovered cells.",
            "Designed a schlieren imaging system from a lenticular lens array and commodity hardware to image refraction in transparent media.",
            "Fabricated PDMS microfluidic devices for single-cell screening in a Class 1000 cleanroom: photolithography, mold preparation and assembly."
          ],
          "tags": [],
          "url": ""
        },
